---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Program">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-10 sm:px-6 md:py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">Program</h1>

    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-700 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-200">
      The schedule is currently being refined, but the overall structure of the weekend is already taking shape. Explore the key formats below and scroll down for the latest timeline overview.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 flex gap-2 overflow-x-auto pb-2 sm:flex-wrap sm:gap-3 sm:overflow-visible">
      <a class="chip shrink-0" href="#talks">Talks</a>
      <a class="chip shrink-0" href="#posters">Posters</a>
      <a class="chip shrink-0" href="#workshops">Workshops</a>
      <a class="chip shrink-0" href="#panel">Panel</a>
      <a class="chip shrink-0" href="#judging">Judging</a>
      <a class="chip shrink-0" href="#networking">Networking</a>
      <a class="chip chip-active shrink-0" href="#timeline">Timeline</a>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 md:mt-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div id="talks" class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold sm:text-xl">Team talks</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          Short presentations by participating iGEM teams, including time for questions, transitions, and feedback.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="posters" class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold sm:text-xl">Poster session</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          An interactive poster format for exchanging ideas, discussing projects, and getting direct input from peers and guests.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="workshops" class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold sm:text-xl">Workshops</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          Hands-on sessions on relevant iGEM topics, skills, and practical aspects of project development and communication.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="panel" class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold sm:text-xl">Panel discussions</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          Open discussions with invited guests on judging, science communication, project quality, and the broader iGEM experience.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="judging" class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold sm:text-xl">Judging session</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          A dedicated session focused on judging expectations, feedback culture, and how to prepare effectively for the Grand Jamboree.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div id="networking" class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold sm:text-xl">Networking</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          Time to meet other teams, speakers, and guests in a relaxed setting throughout the weekend.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="timeline" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 pb-10 sm:px-6 md:pb-16">
    <div class="card card-dark p-5 sm:p-6 md:p-8">
      <div class="mb-8">
        <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
          Event timeline
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-3xl">
          Schedule Overview
        </h2>

        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
          This timeline reflects the current planning status for the weekend. Individual sessions, timings, and room allocations may still be adjusted.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6">
        <!-- Friday -->
        <details open class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
                Friday
              </p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">July 10</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 transition group-open:rotate-180 dark:text-slate-400">
              ▼
            </span>
          </summary>

          <div class="relative mt-6 pl-7 sm:pl-8">
            <div class="absolute left-[10px] top-0 h-full w-px bg-slate-200 sm:left-[11px] dark:bg-slate-700"></div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">⏱</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">16:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Arrival of the teams</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">📋</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">17:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">General welcome</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🎤</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">17:15</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Prof. Dr.-Ing. Jochen Schmid: Opening Talk
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🎙️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">17:45</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Prof. Dr. Dirk Prüfer: The Current State of Biotechnology
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🌿</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">18:20</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Icebreaker & BBQ
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🌃</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">21:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Bar-Hopping
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Saturday -->
        <details open class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
                Saturday
              </p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">July 11</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 transition group-open:rotate-180 dark:text-slate-400">
              ▼
            </span>
          </summary>

          <div class="relative mt-6 pl-7 sm:pl-8">
            <div class="absolute left-[10px] top-0 h-full w-px bg-slate-200 sm:left-[11px] dark:bg-slate-700"></div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">☀️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">08:30</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Arrival of the teams</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">📋</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">09:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Welcome</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🎙️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">09:20</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Issei Nakazato: Rewriting Photosynthesis for Yield improvement: Chloroplast-Targeted DNA Base Editing
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">☕</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">10:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Changeover & drinks break</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🧪</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">10:15</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Team presentations</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🍽️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">12:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Lunch break</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🎙️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">13:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Jan Bruder: From Science to Start up - The PEARL story
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🎙️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">14:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Katherina Sewald: Beyond Animal Testing: Exploring Human Tissue and Cell Models in Biomedical Science
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">📸</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">14:30</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Group photo</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🛠️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">14:45</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Workshops + Poster session</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🧾</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">16:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Poster session</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🔥</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">18:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Day wrap-up</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🍻</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">21:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Peacock</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>

        <!-- Sunday -->
        <details open class="group rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/80 p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/50">
          <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400">
                Sunday
              </p>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold">July 12</h3>
            </div>
            <span class="text-sm font-medium text-slate-500 transition group-open:rotate-180 dark:text-slate-400">
              ▼
            </span>
          </summary>

          <div class="relative mt-6 pl-7 sm:pl-8">
            <div class="absolute left-[10px] top-0 h-full w-px bg-slate-200 sm:left-[11px] dark:bg-slate-700"></div>

            <div class="space-y-8">
              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🥐</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">08:30</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Breakfast</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">⚖️</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">10:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Judging Panel</p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">🏆</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">11:30</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">
                  Closing moderation, including team photo and thank-you
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="relative">
                <div class="absolute left-[-28px] top-1 flex h-5 w-5 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500 text-[10px] text-slate-950 shadow-sm sm:left-[-32px] sm:h-6 sm:w-6 sm:text-xs">👋</div>
                <p class="font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">13:00</p>
                <p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 sm:text-base dark:text-slate-300">Departure</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>